# Logic & Reasoning

Terms grouped by their lowered OntoUML/UFO stereotype (the `logic:` discipline each term carries). See the slice doctrine under `slices/core/logic` for the stereotype semantics.

## Compiler products

The `logic:` compiler emits four information products from one canonical program. Each has a dedicated page:

- [Canonical IR](canonical-ir/index.md) — the one AST / RDF 1.2 identity serialization the compiler produces.
- [Preservation loss ledger](loss-ledger/index.md) — per projection target: preservation kind, complexity class, and structural lossy drops.
